  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine Recovery Conference 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO support to the Ukraine All Party Parliamentary Group&#x2019;s Ukraine Recovery Conference side event on 21 June. FCDO support will develop and deliver the content. this side event brought Ukrainian parliamentarians to the UK to meet with their UK OPOs to discuss bilateral cooperation around Ukraine&apos;s reform, reconstruction, and recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
